<title>USA: Federal Signal Corp Q4 net up after items.</title>
<headline>Federal Signal Corp Q4 net up after items.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			 18,317		   11,709</p>
<p> Revs		     222,944		  221,760</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,988		   45,849</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.35		    $1.13</p>
<p> Net			 62,033		   51,610</p>
<p> Revs		     896,357		  816,127</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,952		   45,859</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 and 1996 Q4 shr and net include one-time after-tax gain of $2.8 million on sale of small tool business. 1995 and 1995 Q4 net and shr include one-time after-tax charge of $4.2 million on litigation settlement.</p>
<p>Excluding one-time items, 1996 Q4 shr was $$0.34 vs $0.35; 1996 shr was $1.29 vs $1.22.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
